		{
			id: "0778ACD6AAB0BFA3"
			title: "Hang the Door, Windows, Bed and Sconce"
			subtitle: "The holes are already in the walls."
			icon: "mcwdoors:oak_cottage_door"
			description: ["Josie: \"A house is a box until somebody shuts a door in it. Go and shut the door.\"", "", "Put the &aOak Cottage Door&r in the doorway, one &aOak Window&r in each hole, the Red Bed on the wool mat and the Sconce on the hook. Any order is right.", "", "The cottage becomes a home you can cook in, and the smoke off it is what brings Marnie up the hill."]
