			description: ["Josie: \"The dark out here has opinions. The tall torch settles them, permanently.\"", "", "Place the &aMegatorch&r on the cottage floor, inside the walls, where you can see it from the bed.", "", "Nothing &chostile&r spawns near home again. The two spares are for the pens; lamps and lanterns live in &6Home and Town&r."]
