			icon: "herbalbrews:copper_tea_kettle"
			description: ["Josie: \"Kettle on the hook, soup in the pot. That is the entire ceremony.\"", "", "Set the &acampfire&r down outside your door, hang the &aCopper Kettle&r over it, and cook one &aVegetable Soup&r in the Cooking Pot: cabbage, carrot, potato, beetroot and a bowl. Three planks make four bowls.", "", "Bram's Surveyor's Stake is in the vegetable basket, in a rag with a chalk K on it. Ovens and kettles: &6Cooking and Brewing&r."]
