		{
			id: "7B69878FA5D50650"
			title: "Drive the Stake into Bram's Socket"
			subtitle: "Cut forty years ago. Never used."
			icon: "valley:town_anchor"
			description: ["Josie: \"Bram surveyed that flat twice, cut the socket, and never drove the stake. Forty years of nearly. Drive it.\"", "", "Walk up the road to the square (&b-302 69 -44&r). The chiselled socket is two blocks north of the town waystone, Bram's own sign beside it. Put the &aSurveyor's Stake&r in it.", "", "Nothing is built. The square has stood here since long before you came — what changes is that the town is on the record, and the first two lamps come on."]
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
