			description: ["Marnie: \"Four years I've looked at that chimney, and last night there was smoke. I've brought bread and I am not carrying it home.\"", "", "Sleep one night in the &aRed Bed&r in your cottage.", "", "Marnie opens the inn she has kept with no guests in it, Bram opens the mill, and she leaves you her seed sack, 32 &aGreen Oak Planks&r and a flint and steel."]
